WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.033 --> 00:00:01.834
-We actually had a great show

00:00:01.834 --> 00:00:03.801
last night. Jared Leto was here.

00:00:03.801 --> 00:00:05.734
His new Marvel movie,
"Morbius"...

00:00:05.734 --> 00:00:07.200
-Ooh.
-...is out this weekend.

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:08.934
I'm always blown away by how

00:00:08.934 --> 00:00:11.567
he's able to disappear
into his roles.

00:00:11.567 --> 00:00:12.834
[ Laughter ]
Really, it's amazing.

00:00:12.834 --> 00:00:15.367
Actually, something amazing
last night

00:00:15.367 --> 00:00:17.367
when Jared was here
right before the show.

00:00:17.367 --> 00:00:18.434
-Really?
-Check this out.

00:00:20.133 --> 00:00:21.300
[ Knocks ]
Hey, Jared!

00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:22.734
I'm so excited you're
on the show tonight.

00:00:22.734 --> 00:00:23.801
Just wanted to --

00:00:23.801 --> 00:00:26.200
[ Laughter ]
Oh. Sorry.

00:00:26.200 --> 00:00:27.501
I thought this was Jared's room.

00:00:27.501 --> 00:00:29.400
-It is.

00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:30.701
-What do you mean?

00:00:30.701 --> 00:00:34.167
♪♪

00:00:34.167 --> 00:00:35.133
[ Cheering and applause ]
What?

00:00:35.133 --> 00:00:36.901
-I was just in character.

00:00:36.901 --> 00:00:38.701
-That's incredible.

00:00:38.701 --> 00:00:40.200
You really disappear
in your roles.

00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:42.000
I was going to say,
I just saw "Morbius"

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:43.667
and I barely recognized you,
at first.

00:00:43.667 --> 00:00:45.601
-I appreciate that.
I really do.

00:00:45.601 --> 00:00:46.901
-Hey, Jimmy.
What's going on?

00:00:46.901 --> 00:00:49.000
-Oh, hey, Higgins.
I was just saying hi to Jared.

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:50.534
-Jared?

00:00:50.534 --> 00:00:52.133
There's nobody in here with you.

00:00:52.133 --> 00:00:53.133
-What do you mean?

00:00:53.133 --> 00:00:54.801
[ Suspenseful music plays ]

00:00:54.801 --> 00:00:57.634
Where'd he go?

00:00:57.634 --> 00:00:58.634
-Right here.

00:00:58.634 --> 00:01:01.033
-Again, unrecognizable.

00:01:01.033 --> 00:01:03.400
I don't even understand
how you do it. It's so good!

00:01:03.400 --> 00:01:05.434
-I'm just kidding.

00:01:05.434 --> 00:01:06.501
It was really me.

00:01:06.501 --> 00:01:09.033
[ Laughter ]
-Oh.

00:01:09.033 --> 00:01:10.234
-Got you again.

00:01:10.234 --> 00:01:11.467
-I can't believe it.

00:01:11.467 --> 00:01:14.801
You were Jared,
pretending to be Higgins,

00:01:14.801 --> 00:01:16.300
pretending to be Jared,

00:01:16.300 --> 00:01:18.200
pretending to be Higgins?

00:01:18.200 --> 00:01:19.267
-Almost.

00:01:19.267 --> 00:01:20.267
But --But no.

00:01:20.267 --> 00:01:22.901
I-I'm not Jared.

00:01:22.901 --> 00:01:24.701
-Then who are you?

00:01:24.701 --> 00:01:26.367
[ Laughter ]
-I'm Jimmy.

00:01:26.367 --> 00:01:29.400
-Then that makes me...

00:01:29.400 --> 00:01:32.133
-Yep.

00:01:32.133 --> 00:01:33.701
-...Jared.

00:01:33.701 --> 00:01:34.834
-Incredible.

00:01:34.834 --> 00:01:36.400
-Not too bad yourself.

00:01:36.400 --> 00:01:37.467
-Thank you.

00:01:37.467 --> 00:01:39.567
So, wait, where is Higgins?

00:01:39.567 --> 00:01:43.434
♪♪

00:01:43.434 --> 00:01:44.968
-My first guest stars
in "Morbius."

00:01:44.968 --> 00:01:46.701
[ Laughter ]
Give it up for Jared Leto!

00:01:46.701 --> 00:01:49.467
[ Cheering and applause ]
[ The Roots play funk ]

00:01:49.467 --> 00:01:52.567
[ Laughter ]

00:01:52.567 --> 00:01:54.434
-You know what?
Let him have it.

00:01:54.434 --> 00:01:55.901
Want to grab a bite?

00:01:55.901 --> 00:01:58.100
-Thought you'd never ask.
[ Hiss ]

00:01:58.100 --> 00:02:00.300
-♪ The jig is up,
the news is out ♪

00:02:00.300 --> 00:02:02.367
♪ They finally found me ♪

00:02:02.367 --> 00:02:03.968
[ Cheering and applause ]
♪ The renegade ♪

